  {
   "id": "operation-tango-134822@major-2026-05-05",
   "gameId": "operation-tango-134822",
   "displayName": "Happy Bastards just got a playtest update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-05T18:02:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Our next game, Happy Bastards, just got a playtest update!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've just updated our playtest with new features and improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45052172/3155da7a2cb7770e82e1373c563efaffcbdbdd8e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version Updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This new version includes many changes. We won’t bother you with the details here, as you can read it all in the game’s splash screen, but in summary:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• New art style",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• The character generator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Inspect mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Dungeon exploration",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Dungeon events; including traps, dialogues and dilemmas",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Loot; including potions and battle charms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Out-of-combat HUD and UI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• A few new combat elements, like the Meatshield ability or the Goblin Dung Slinger",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Many improvements to existing combat features, stats and UX",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In other words, the aim with v3 was to go beyond a simple combat playtest, and to expand it to be a dungeon delve simulation. Of course, this is in no way complete or fully polished, but we’re adding to the experience one step at a time. Let us know if you think we are on the right track.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The step after this one? The open world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Want to get your hands on the playtest?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you're already a part of our Discord and have a playtest key, you'll just need to update the game on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "New to Happy Bastards? You can sign up for the playtest and get your key in our Discord at:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "GLHF and let us know what you think",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
